<p style="font-size:25px;text-align:center;"><strong>Relocation of Van Nuys Parking Adjudication Office</strong></p>

<p>Earlier this week, LADOT's Van Nuys Parking Adjudication Office moved to a new location to better accommodate members of the public, relocating to 5990 Sepulveda Blvd, Suite 225, Los Angeles, CA 91411.</p>

<p><a name="speed" id="speed"></a></p>

